            "status": "active",
            "short_description": "Indie, Pop, Rock, Folk",
            "internal_notes": "Don’t Tell Daisy is an emerging four-piece band comprised of two sisters (Holly, Lottie) and two mates (Harley, Aidan) from the Wheatbelt towns of Popanyinning and Narrogin, Western Australia. After growing up together and playing cover gigs for a few years, the band launched Don’t Tell Daisy in late 2023. Don’t Tell Daisy uses raw lyrics to tell stories, and has an indie/folk sound, characterised by the sister’s harmonies, extraordinary drumming and complimenting rhythm sections.",
