            "formation_year": 2023,
            "status": "active",
            "short_description": "Indie, Alternative, Rock",
            "internal_notes": "About Yesterday is a high-energy indie/alt-rock trio made up of WAM awarding musicians Annalise Feilding, Sebastian Smith and Brady Jansen. They’ve supported acts like Sly Withers, Dear Sunday, Siobhan Cotchin and Lazy Haze. Their emotionally charged songwriting, tight musicianship, and magnetic live presence have quickly earned them a loyal following. With a sound that’s raw, heartfelt and full of energy, they’re quickly becoming a standout in the Australian music scene.",
